Purpose of the Position &nbsp;

As Product Manager, Publisher Payments, you will own and evolve Awin's global publisher payments experience, ensuring publishers are paid accurately, on time, and through payment methods that best meet their needs. &nbsp;

You will shape how Awin delivers seamless payment experiences across countries, currencies and regulatory environments, balancing compliance, operational efficiency and customer experience. You will identify opportunities to simplify payment journeys, improve transparency and trust, and help publishers get paid with confidence, wherever they are in the world. &nbsp;

Working closely with product, engineering, finance, support, operations and compliance teams, you will define and deliver solutions that create value for publishers, support business growth and enable Awin to scale its global payments capabilities. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

Key Tasks

• Evolve Awin’s publisher payments experience, ensuring payments are accurate, timely and trusted by publishers across the globe

• Define, prioritize and deliver product initiatives that improve the publisher payments experience, end-to-end

