At Flix, we offer a dynamic work environment with competitive pay, strong growth opportunities, and a tech-driven approach to making travel more accessible, sustainable, and affordable. &nbsp;

To strengthen our team in France, we are looking for a motivated and driven Shop Employee (m/f/d) for our FlixBus Shop at the &nbsp; Paris Pershing bus station. You will support the day-to-day running of the shop, deliver high-quality service to our passengers, and help ensure smooth operations throughout your shift. &nbsp;

This is a fixed-term contract from 12 October to 31 October 2026, working on a shift basis across the full week, including weekdays and weekends. &nbsp;

Please submit your CV in English language!

About the Role

• Sell tickets and process reservations, cancellations, and changes using our sales systems &nbsp;

• Provide high-quality service to passengers, assisting with check-in and offering clear travel information &nbsp;

• Handle cash and card payments reliably, ensuring correct daily reconciliation &nbsp;

• Monitor bus departures and arrivals, and communicate any delays or changes to passengers &nbsp;

• Support smooth day-to-day station operations in coordination with colleagues and station teams &nbsp;

About You

• Enjoys helping people and delivers friendly, patient customer service &nbsp;

• Reliable, proactive, and a strong team player &nbsp;

• Stays calm and solution-oriented during busy periods &nbsp;

• Comfortable using computers and digital tools &nbsp;

• Available to work shifts from Monday to Sunday during the contract period &nbsp;

• Fluent in French and English &nbsp;

We recognize that everyone carries a unique set of valuable skills and experiences. If you think you could have an impact even though you don't meet 100% of the requirements, we still encourage you to apply. We want to hear from you! &nbsp;

Please submit your CV in English language!

What We Offer

• Travel perks: free Flix voucher + discount voucher for friends &amp; family &nbsp;

• Wellbeing support: Access confidential 1:1 counselling, courses, and stress management for yourself and up to four family members &nbsp;

• Learning &amp; Development: Take advantage of language classes, training courses, and expert-led sessions to grow your skills &nbsp;

• Mentoring Program: Connect with experienced colleagues to gain insights and accelerate your career &nbsp;

To view more local benefits specific to each office location, please check out this link: &nbsp; Locations - Flix Career

Why Join Flix?

At Flix, you’ll find teams that rally together to overcome challenges and spark creativity. We believe in ownership culture - giving you the freedom to take initiative, make an impact, and shape your own career path.
As we continue to expand across the globe, you can make a real difference in how we work.

If you’re ready to grow and lead your journey, Flix is the place for you!&nbsp;

